From 3172eb8482ae89c4f7925ba12394d47b78393d40 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 13:06:37 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] webui: the Storage and Analytics help buttons point at the
 live guide heading

Both pages linked REAPER-GUIDE.md#411-long-term-storage-data-export-and-the-
reaper-settings-backup, the slug of a heading renamed on 2026-08-29 when the
settings backup moved to Administration. GitHub shows the top of the page for
an unknown anchor, so the two ? buttons have landed nowhere since about v2.7.4.
They now link #411-long-term-storage-and-data-export. The guide keeps a compat
anchor for the old slug so images already in the field resolve too.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_Analytics.asp | 2 +-
 release/src/router/www/Reaper_Storage.asp   | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

